# rootround.part -- A block on a block, flush at two sides, with round roots
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

profile r along z 0 0 0 20 0 0 20 10 0 0 10 0
extrude blk from 0 to 5 r
profile q along z 5 0 0 15 0 0 15 10 0 5 10 0
extrude top from 5 to 7 q
union u blk top
round 0.5 blk.end top
